{"chapter": "desirables", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02BB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$H^2(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{F})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-section-introduction}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:77f397656dbc413736e10398c474c7a5c6c54c0592e54e755c761813b42ed605", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:348e65d802706889c11f8ff09849722122e02a78236262d267a0c3927acbf5cb", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe have a chapter on (abstract) stacks, see\nStacks, Section <REF_0001>.\nIt would be nice if\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> improve the discussion on ``stackyfication'',\n<STRUCT_0004> give examples of stackyfication,\n<STRUCT_0005> more examples in general,\n<STRUCT_0006> improve the discussion of gerbes.\n<STRUCT_0007>\nExample result which has not been added yet: Given a sheaf of abelian\ngroups <MATH_0001>\nover <MATH_0002> the set of equivalence classes of gerbes banded by\n<MATH_0003> is bijective to <MATH_0004>.\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9cfb3eaa4fa400c60a5c3bc900609dac49cee99f316b0e051ce138510511c44f", "unit_id": "tag:02BB:prose-0001"}
